# Auditor — Cannot Generate Documents

## Critical Rule

**Auditor is NOT allowed to generate invoices, receipts, tax invoices or credit notes.**

Auditor may only:

1. Send billing request to VOW billing system
2. Wait for document creation
3. Return the download link

**Document creation must only occur in the VOW billing system.**

